tached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment32","raw_text":"    红升车是适时的巧着，迫使黑方联卒自阻车路，以便攻击。黑如改走卒5进1，则马七进五，车6平5，马五进三，将5平6，炮五平四，黑不行。","text":"    红升车是适时的巧着，迫使黑方联卒自阻车路，以便攻击。黑如改走卒5进1，则马七进五，车6平5，马五进三，将5平6，炮五平四，黑不行。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment35:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment35","raw_text":"    如图形势，红以车砍炮使黑将不安于位，是杀王入局的凶着，早在红方的算度之内。","text":"    如图形势，红以车砍炮使黑将不安于位，是杀王入局的凶着，早在红方的算度之内。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":35,"anchor_node_id":"0:35","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment50:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment50","raw_text":"    黑如将5平4，则马三进四，红胜。","text":"    黑如将5平4，则马三进四，红胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":50,"anchor_node_id":"0:50","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment51:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment51","raw_text":"    黑胜。||","text":"    黑胜。\n","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":51,"anchor_node_id":"0:51","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["072黑龙江王嘉良 先胜 吉林刘凤春"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第二章 顺手炮、列手炮(32局)"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["D03 顺炮横车对缓开车"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":14,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":51,"legal_move_records":51,"annotations":8,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":8}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第二章 顺手炮、列手炮 黑龙江王嘉良 先胜 吉林刘凤春","catalogue_order":71,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-66-3.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
